@title: A step that changes the address waits for what the new address shows
# expect-output: first=[3 on page 1]
# expect-output: second=[2 on page 2]
STEP 1: Enter changes the address; the results come from a request
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/spa.html
    FILL 'Search' field with 'manul'
    PRESS ENTER
    EXTRACT the 'Results' into {first}
    PRINT "first=[{first}]"
STEP 2: So does a link that the app handles itself
    CLICK the 'Next page' link
    EXTRACT the 'Results' into {second}
    PRINT "second=[{second}]"
DONE.
